        "title": "Community contract cuts leagues to three and adds prize and heat",
        "summary": "The shared community contract in `common/src/community/contract.ts` reduces `COMMUNITY_LEAGUES` from five values to three, removing platinum and `diamond` and leaving `bronze`, `silver`, and `gold`. The comment notes that a league stored from before this change that is not in the list reads as the top one via `effectiveLeague`. The diff also adds an optional `heat` field to `CommunityPost`, an optional `rising` array to `CommunityFeed`, and a new `CommunityLeaguePrizes` type referenced by an optional `prizes` field on `CommunityLeagueBoard`.",
