        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The community leaderboard now has three skill levels instead of five, with the two highest tiers removed. To encourage competition, the top spots in each level can now win extra usage time as a prize, and new items in the community feed can be labeled as hot, rising, or new to show which ones are getting attention right now. These updates set the stage for how you see rankings and recommendations, but the prize amounts and label displays will appear only when the community section is fully active.",
